Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 21:29:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] infinity fair: bounded-LIFO ordering with weighted quantum and expiry

Structures plus LIFO order with tree retirement, weighted quantum plus
expiry plus preempt plus yield plus reweight-delta, and dead-code
cleanup (vruntime retirement, no stats/sysctl/Kconfig/trace).

Signed-off-by: Galih Tama <galpt@v.recipes>
